 "arithmetic_lines": [
  "shapes   X 40×30 (electrodes × bins)   A = XX′ 40×40   W 40×4   F = W′X 4×30   G 40×4   X̂ = G F 40×30",
  "",
  "Gram, two entries.   A[i,l] = Σ_t X[i,t]·X[l,t]   (sum over the 30 bins)",
  "  i = EL035 TTG_R1, l = EL035 TTG_R4 (both auditory):   4.29×4.54 + 4.04×4.35 + 3.75×4.01 + … (27 more, summing +38.39)",
  "     = +90.4   →  A⁺[i,l] = 90.4,  A⁻[i,l] = 0.0",
  "  i = EL035 TTG_R1, m = PAT_3965 ad10 (auditory vs negative):   4.29×-1.09 + 4.04×-2.16 + 3.75×-2.49 + … (27 more, summing -27.02)",
  "     = -49.7   →  A⁺[i,m] = 0.0,  A⁻[i,m] = 49.7      (the sign goes into WHICH half, the size stays)",
  "",
  "Component, one entry.   F[c_aud, audio bin 0] = Σ_i W[i, c_aud]·X[i, bin 0]   (W′s column sums to 1, so this is a weighted average of the 40 electrodes)",
  "  = 0.18×4.29 (EL035 TTG_R1) + 0.15×4.54 (EL035 TTG_R4) + 0.17×3.05 (EL043 STG2) + 0.12×3.94 (EL035 TTG_R2) + … (36 more, summing +0.96)  =  +3.39 dB",
  "",
  "Reconstruction, one entry.   X̂[i, bin 0] = Σ_j G[i,j]·F[j, bin 0]   for i = EL035 TTG_R1",
  "  = 0.15×-0.65 (c_neg) + 0.00×+0.37 (c_mot) + 0.05×+0.05 (c_vis) + 1.29×+3.39 (c_aud)  =  +4.29 dB     measured X[i, bin 0] = +4.29,  residual -0.00",
  "",
  "One update of one W entry, from the pipeline's initialisation (k-means labels → G = 0.2 + one-hot + noise, W = G / colsum):",
  "  W[i,j] ← W[i,j] · √( (A⁺G + A⁻W G′G)[i,j] / (A⁻G + A⁺W G′G)[i,j] )   for i = EL035 TTG_R1, j = 3:",
  "  = 0.0658 · √( (725.2 + 335.1) / (109.1 + 975.9) )  =  0.0658 · 0.989  =  0.0650      (A⁺G pulls the weight up where i agrees with what already loads on j; A⁻G pushes it down)",
  "",
  "Fit after 300 iterations:   ‖X − G W′X‖ / ‖X‖ = 0.287   →  92% of the variance;   argmax(G) puts 39 of 40 electrodes in their own group."
 ],
